§ `ss 189, 190 -- when a youth conviction stops counting`

#ASSERT NOT `Has my youth conviction stopped counting` `a conviction with detention discharged 1 December 2022` (Date 30 11 2024)
#ASSERT `Has my youth conviction stopped counting` `a conviction with detention discharged 1 December 2022` (Date 1 12 2024)
